{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b File operations:} - Double-click: open in default macOS app via {\f1 NSWorkspace} - Drag out: drag file to Finder - Drag in: upload file to that directory - Right-click: Copy path, Delete, Rename\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Data source:}\par}
