{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 5.3 WebSocket Protocol\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.1 Connection\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 WebSocket connection established to:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 wss://<gateway-host>/ws?token=<bearer-token>\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Or with header-based auth (preferred, if supported by gateway):\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 GET /ws HTTP/1.1\line
Host: ubuntu-ct.tailb4a099.ts.net\line
Upgrade: websocket\line
Connection: Upgrade\line
Authorization: Bearer <token>\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The gateway should prefer header-based auth as query string tokens appear in server logs.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.2 Heartbeat\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The client sends a ping frame every 30 seconds. If no pong is received within 10 seconds, the connection is considered dead and reconnect begins.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 // Heartbeat implementation\line
func startHeartbeat() \{\line
    heartbeatTask = Task \{\line
        while !Task.isCancelled \{\line
            try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(30))\line
            await webSocket.sendPing()\line
            // await pong within 10s or reconnect\line
        \}\line
    \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.3 Message Envelope\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 All messages are JSON. Both directions use the same envelope structure:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "id": "msg_<uuid>",\line
  "type": "chat" | "event" | "control" | "ack" | "error",\line
  "session_id": "sess_<uuid>",\line
  "timestamp": 1740499200,\line
  "payload": \{ ... \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.4 Outbound Message Types\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Send chat message:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "id": "msg_abc123",\line
  "type": "chat",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "timestamp": 1740499200,\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "content": "Analyze the Q4 financials in my workspace",\line
    "attachments": [\line
      \{ "path": "/root/.openclaw/workspace/uploads/q4.pdf" \}\line
    ]\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Steer (Phase 2):}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "id": "msg_abc124",\line
  "type": "control",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "timestamp": 1740499201,\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "action": "steer",\line
    "steer_action": "pause" | "stop" | "redirect",\line
    "message": "Focus on the revenue section only"\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Approval response (Phase 2):}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "id": "msg_abc125",\line
  "type": "control",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "timestamp": 1740499202,\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "action": "approval_response",\line
    "request_id": "req_abc123",\line
    "approved": true\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.5 Inbound Message Types\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Message ACK:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "ack",\line
  "payload": \{ "message_id": "msg_abc123" \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Streaming token:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "chat",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "message_id": "resp_def456",\line
    "role": "assistant",\line
    "content": "Looking at the Q4 financials",\line
    "streaming": true,\line
    "token": " revenue"\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Stream complete:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "chat",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "message_id": "resp_def456",\line
    "role": "assistant",\line
    "streaming": false,\line
    "final_content": "Looking at the Q4 financials, revenue grew 23% YoY..."\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Agent event (Phase 2):}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "event",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "event_kind": "tool_call",\line
    "event_id": "evt_ghi789",\line
    "tool": "Read",\line
    "args": \{ "file_path": "/root/.openclaw/workspace/q4.pdf" \},\line
    "status": "running" | "complete" | "error",\line
    "result": null,\line
    "duration_ms": null\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Approval request (Phase 2):}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "event",\line
  "session_id": "sess_xyz789",\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "event_kind": "approval_request",\line
    "request_id": "req_abc123",\line
    "action": "exec",\line
    "description": "Run: rm -rf /tmp/old_cache",\line
    "risk_level": "medium",\line
    "timeout_seconds": 120\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b Error:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 \{\line
  "type": "error",\line
  "payload": \{\line
    "code": "auth_failed" | "session_not_found" | "rate_limit" | "internal",\line
    "message": "Authentication token is invalid or expired"\line
  \}\line
\}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.3.6 REST API Endpoints\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Beyond WebSocket, the gateway exposes REST for session/agent management and file operations. All authenticated with {\f1 Authorization: Bearer <token>}.\par}
