{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.5.2 Error Presentation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Transient errors} (connection blip, upload retry): Toast notification, bottom of window, auto-dismisses in 4s\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Persistent errors} (auth failure, configuration): Inline in connection status area with an action button (\u8220"Re-enter credentials\u8221")\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Silent errors} (parse failure on single message): Logged to debug console, shown as error placeholder bubble\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 5.5.3 Offline Behavior\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 When disconnected: - Chat input is disabled with placeholder: \u8220"Reconnecting to gateway\u8230 ?\u8221" - Session list shows cached data from SQLite - Message history is fully readable from cache - Any draft message is preserved in input field across reconnects - Outbound messages queued (up to 10) and sent on reconnect, in order\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 6. UI/UX Specification\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 6.1 Design Language\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Framework:} SwiftUI with AppKit interop where needed\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Appearance:} Follows system appearance (light/dark auto-switch via {\f1 @Environment(\\.colorScheme)})\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Typography:} System font (SF Pro) throughout. Monospace: SF Mono for code\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Color palette:} Follows macOS system accent color. No custom brand colors that clash with system UI\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Iconography:} SF Symbols exclusively. No custom icon sets in MVP\sa180\par}
