{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Appendix A: Gateway Protocol Notes\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This spec assumes the following gateway capabilities exist or will be added:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab {\b WebSocket endpoint at {\f1 /ws}} with header-based auth\par}
